## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=nursery/noTailwindRawColors '<TEMP_DIR>/no_tailwind_raw_colors_suggests_stylesheet_colors'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./src/app.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "noTailwindRawColors": "error" } } }
}
```

## `src/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const pink = <div className="bg-pink-500" />;
export const gray = <div className="hover:text-slate-100/80" />;

```

## `src/app.css`

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@import "./theme.css";
```

## `src/index.html`

```html
<div class="dark:border-t-red-600/50!"></div>

```

## `src/theme.css`

```css
@theme {
    --color-brand: #ec4899;
    --color-danger: oklch(0.58 0.24 27);
    --color-surface: #fff;
    --color-muted: oklch(0.97 0 0);
    --color-primary: var(--primary);
    --color-pink-400: #f472b6;
}
```

